WEBVTT

01:45.920 --> 01:46.760
Come in.

01:51.120 --> 01:54.000
Didn't Doctor Chen ask you to spend
more time with Su Chengcheng?

01:54.080 --> 01:55.320
You took her home,

01:55.400 --> 01:57.200
so why didn't you have dinner with her?

02:05.560 --> 02:07.640
What's wrong? You got hit?

02:11.039 --> 02:11.880
Nothing.

02:14.880 --> 02:16.960
I know how to cure my eyes.

02:19.240 --> 02:21.320
Is it tricky?

02:22.280 --> 02:24.400
Intimate physical contact.

02:25.280 --> 02:26.280
How intimate?

02:29.760 --> 02:30.920
Hug.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.480
Hug?

02:33.800 --> 02:36.520
Like this…

02:39.840 --> 02:41.000
What about holding hands?

02:44.120 --> 02:45.760
It can only help me see myself.

02:48.320 --> 02:50.320
Did Su Chengcheng hit you?

02:52.760 --> 02:53.600
No.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.400
It was an accident.

02:59.320 --> 03:01.160
It is really a tricky method,

03:01.240 --> 03:04.040
but it's better than no method.

03:04.120 --> 03:05.040
It's okay.

03:05.120 --> 03:07.440
We'll figure it out.

03:09.960 --> 03:11.800
I held her hand,

03:13.080 --> 03:15.120
and she nearly broke my arm.

03:17.560 --> 03:19.120
If I try to hold her,

03:20.160 --> 03:22.160
maybe she'll break my neck.

03:23.480 --> 03:25.560
My eyes might be cured,

03:26.320 --> 03:27.840
but you'll need

03:28.480 --> 03:29.840
to bring me back from death.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.680
Su Chengcheng is not the only one.

03:36.760 --> 03:38.200
You can hold Quan Shengtang.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.920
Even if I want to,

03:41.440 --> 03:42.840
will he agree?

03:43.920 --> 03:46.120
How can you know if you don't try?

03:50.080 --> 03:51.440
SOUL DETECTIVE

03:51.520 --> 03:53.560
Is… Is this Quan Shengtang?

03:54.640 --> 03:56.760
I'm thinking about my work.

03:56.840 --> 03:59.240
Maybe I can help you solve your problem.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.880
Hello, Wang Yi. Do you have time?

04:07.920 --> 04:08.680
PROPOSAL FOR MILLENNIA OF BEAUTY FAIR

04:08.760 --> 04:09.640
Hello.

04:09.720 --> 04:13.760
This is our group's proposal
for Millennia of Beauty Fair.

04:18.399 --> 04:19.680
We're planning

04:19.760 --> 04:22.640
to combine ancient Chinese animation
and traditional culture

04:22.720 --> 04:24.640
and organize online and offline events

04:24.720 --> 04:26.480
to attract people of different ages

04:26.560 --> 04:28.320
and create unique works

04:28.400 --> 04:30.200
with profound cultural connotations.

04:30.280 --> 04:31.160
For online events,

04:31.240 --> 04:34.480
we will cooperate with well-known
Chinese animation IPs.

04:34.560 --> 04:37.680
It will not only attract young comic fans,

04:37.760 --> 04:40.920
but also raise public awareness
of domestic brands.

04:42.440 --> 04:47.000
These are the male and female makeup
of different dynasties.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.640
For offline events,

04:57.720 --> 05:00.200
we'll hold a traditional makeup fair,

05:00.280 --> 05:01.840
utilizing traditional culture

05:01.920 --> 05:05.320
to explore the development of beauty

05:05.400 --> 05:07.640
so as to attract older people.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.080
It's a good proposal.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.400
Any suitable cartoonist?

05:16.320 --> 05:18.360
Based on our careful selection,
we have three options.

05:18.960 --> 05:20.680
First, Lin Qiaqia,

05:21.200 --> 05:23.080
who graduated from
the Central Academy of Fine Arts,

05:23.160 --> 05:26.440
with famous works such as
The Day We Met and Soul Detective.

05:26.960 --> 05:30.400
Soul Detective is a gripping
suspense comic book

05:30.480 --> 05:33.680
about the detective's adventures.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.920
In a city filled with mysteries

05:35.000 --> 05:37.120
- and conspiracies,
- Didn't you read this the other day?

05:37.200 --> 05:40.160
the detective got involved
in a series of strange cases.

05:40.240 --> 05:43.560
Is this proposal your idea?

05:43.640 --> 05:44.920
The hidden truth.

05:45.000 --> 05:46.960
He started to look
for clues with his friends.

05:47.040 --> 05:49.400
I only gave Wang Yi
some advice on the theme.

05:49.480 --> 05:52.400
She and Su Chengcheng
finished the proposal together.

05:54.320 --> 05:57.320
You're always impressive.

06:13.840 --> 06:14.880
Hello, Ms. Lin.

06:19.920 --> 06:21.080
I'm Gu Yu from TBC.

06:21.160 --> 06:24.080
I want to talk to you
about our cooperation.

06:24.160 --> 06:25.000
Have a seat.

06:32.520 --> 06:34.640
Wang Yi sent me a digital version.

06:34.720 --> 06:36.280
I've read it.

06:42.560 --> 06:44.480
Do you want to make any changes?

06:48.160 --> 06:50.280
This is my first business cooperation.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.520
The price is fair,

06:52.600 --> 06:54.360
the contract is acceptable,

06:55.600 --> 06:57.960
and your company has a good reputation.

06:58.040 --> 07:00.720
My editor urged me to sign this deal,

07:00.800 --> 07:02.480
in case someone else signs it first.

07:09.160 --> 07:11.200
You can't negotiate like this.

07:11.800 --> 07:14.840
You need to be cunning and cautious
before signing a deal,

07:14.920 --> 07:17.080
so that you'll feel at ease

07:17.160 --> 07:18.600
during the cooperation.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.560
How cautious?

07:25.720 --> 07:26.960
Don't worry.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.440
My editor asked a lawyer to check it.

07:28.520 --> 07:30.800
Your contract is fair and has no traps.

07:30.880 --> 07:33.480
Besides, I'm a cartoonist,

07:33.560 --> 07:36.240
whose main income comes from
royalties and licensing fees.

07:36.760 --> 07:40.200
Business cooperation
is only occasional. It's a windfall.

07:40.720 --> 07:44.040
It doesn't matter
if you take advantage of me.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.040
ARTICLE 8: OTHERS
ARTICLE 9: SUPPLEMENTARY PROVISIONS

07:45.120 --> 07:45.960
BUSINESS CONTRACT

07:46.720 --> 07:47.920
No matter what kind of contract,

07:48.440 --> 07:51.080
you have to read it
carefully before signing it.

07:51.160 --> 07:53.360
I've read it.

07:53.880 --> 07:55.600
It's a digital version.

07:55.680 --> 07:58.040
What if I change something
when printing it?

07:58.560 --> 08:00.360
A few different words

08:00.440 --> 08:02.360
may convey completely different meanings.

08:07.320 --> 08:10.560
A bad buy wouldn't give me a heads-up
when he wants to set me up, right?

08:10.640 --> 08:11.800
Just read it.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.560
You've created so many good works.

08:29.640 --> 08:31.680
Is it hard to read a contract?

08:33.559 --> 08:34.600
You don't understand.

08:35.120 --> 08:37.400
It's completely different.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.880
I enjoy drawing

08:39.960 --> 08:41.760
but hate reading contracts.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.760
From now on,
I'll check all your contracts.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.160
I mean…

08:51.240 --> 08:52.400
As a friend

08:52.480 --> 08:55.120
who happens to be good
at contract examination and negotiation,

08:55.760 --> 08:57.760
I'd love to help you

08:57.840 --> 09:00.240
if you face something like this.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.280
Thanks.

09:04.560 --> 09:06.160
PARTY B: LIN QIAQIA

09:21.240 --> 09:22.080
Okay.

09:23.640 --> 09:24.840
Keep it well.

09:34.840 --> 09:35.680
Shake hands.

09:39.240 --> 09:40.160
Glad to work with you.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.280
Glad to work with you.

09:44.720 --> 09:46.760
I'll ask Wang Yi
to contact Quan Shengtang.

09:49.320 --> 09:51.600
Wang Yi will contact Quan Shengtang?

09:52.400 --> 09:55.200
You don't think she's suitable?
Su Chengcheng can also do it.

09:55.280 --> 09:58.080
Contact him for what?

10:01.600 --> 10:02.800
Page 2, item 4.

10:10.800 --> 10:13.720
"Based on the needs of TBC offline events,

10:13.800 --> 10:16.560
Party B shall ask Quan Shengtang,
the character prototype,

10:16.640 --> 10:18.800
to attend Spring Makeup Fair

10:18.880 --> 10:20.760
and cooperate with the promotion."

10:48.560 --> 10:50.600
The event is on the weekend,

10:50.680 --> 10:52.320
and many couples
from nearby cities will come.

10:52.400 --> 10:53.880
We don't have enough rooms,

10:53.960 --> 10:55.480
so two people need to share a room.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.400
Share a room?

10:57.480 --> 10:58.560
What about Quan Shengtang?

10:58.640 --> 11:00.000
Quan Shengtang is our guest.

11:00.080 --> 11:01.600
He'll stay with Mr. Tang.

11:01.680 --> 11:02.640
It's a suite.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.520
Can you arrange a single room for him?

11:05.600 --> 11:06.640
It can be a small room.

11:07.600 --> 11:09.080
No extra rooms.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.840
Mr. Zhou also has to stay with Mr. Gu.

11:21.040 --> 11:22.240
Is there a problem?

11:23.680 --> 11:24.640
No.

11:25.800 --> 11:28.240
Should I keep Quan Shengtang's room card
or give it to you?

11:28.320 --> 11:29.400
We'll take it.

11:30.920 --> 11:32.280
- Sign here.
- Okay.

11:33.600 --> 11:34.880
I'll sign it for you.

11:37.720 --> 11:38.560
Here.

11:40.480 --> 11:41.760
Okay, thanks.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.480
Then I'm leaving. Let's keep in touch.

11:43.560 --> 11:44.400
Okay.

11:53.400 --> 11:54.400
Why are you standing here?

11:54.480 --> 11:56.720
Let's unpack our things and have dinner.

12:06.520 --> 12:07.880
Maybe I should break the deal.

12:08.560 --> 12:09.440
No.

12:09.520 --> 12:11.680
If you do that,
you'll pay the default fine

12:11.760 --> 12:13.760
and other compensations.

12:13.840 --> 12:15.520
We've invested a lot in this.

12:17.760 --> 12:20.200
I didn't read the contract carefully.

12:20.280 --> 12:22.840
My editor and lawyer checked everything,

12:22.920 --> 12:25.400
and they didn't think
Quan Shengtang would be a problem.

12:25.480 --> 12:28.280
I was also careless
and didn't notice that.

12:28.800 --> 12:30.880
Who would refuse to make money?

12:30.960 --> 12:33.800
They didn't know
Quan Shengtang was special.

12:35.600 --> 12:37.640
Why don't you take a day off?

12:39.120 --> 12:42.680
Tang Qi already thinks
I'm a fragile princess.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.000
I can't take a day off.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.320
Don't worry.

12:46.400 --> 12:48.720
I was the one who made the fair proposal.

12:48.800 --> 12:51.560
I've arranged everything.
He won't find out.

13:00.960 --> 13:03.400
Su Chengcheng, I talked to Mr. Tang.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.080
He said Quan Shengtang wasn't there.

13:05.160 --> 13:06.680
Hurry up and confirm it.

13:06.760 --> 13:09.040
Quan Shengtang is essential
to tomorrow's event.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.720
It can't go wrong.

13:11.560 --> 13:14.200
Quan Shengtang has arrived.
He just took his card

13:14.280 --> 13:15.760
and went back to his room.

13:15.840 --> 13:17.080
Okay, bye, Mr. Gu.

13:18.560 --> 13:19.560
Chengcheng.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.920
What's that look?

13:23.000 --> 13:25.000
It's not a suicide mission.

13:25.080 --> 13:28.320
I will show up and prove
he has arrived, and then I'll come back.

13:28.400 --> 13:30.760
Don't worry. I'll be quick.

13:31.440 --> 13:33.800
- I'll wait for you.
- Bye.

14:15.760 --> 14:16.880
Not in the room?

14:37.880 --> 14:39.080
You're here.

14:48.000 --> 14:48.880
I knocked,

14:48.960 --> 14:51.480
but you didn't answer, so I came in.

14:51.560 --> 14:52.880
I heard it.

14:53.800 --> 14:54.840
I was taking a shower.

14:54.920 --> 14:56.440
I thought you were an employee.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.680
What's wrong with him?

15:02.760 --> 15:05.120
Didn't he notice the light is off?

15:05.200 --> 15:06.440
Doesn't he think it's dark?

15:09.080 --> 15:11.040
I used half of the wardrobe.

15:11.120 --> 15:12.360
The other half is for you.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.760
Take a look.

15:13.840 --> 15:16.520
If it's not enough, I can make some space.

15:17.400 --> 15:19.080
Should I check it now?

15:21.480 --> 15:23.200
I thought you'd unpack your things.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.840
You can do it when you have time.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.760
Tang Qi.

15:30.360 --> 15:32.320
Are your eyes infrared?

15:33.120 --> 15:34.000
What?

15:34.840 --> 15:36.360
There is no light,

15:36.440 --> 15:38.520
and you move swiftly

15:38.600 --> 15:40.360
and can even find your clothes.

15:44.560 --> 15:45.600
What's wrong?

15:46.200 --> 15:47.200
It's okay.

15:49.240 --> 15:51.600
I've stayed for a while
and forgot about the light.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.600
My night vision is better than others,

15:53.680 --> 15:55.960
and I know where my clothes are.

15:56.040 --> 15:57.200
I'll get changed.

15:57.720 --> 15:58.960
Are you okay?

15:59.720 --> 16:01.760
I'm fine. I'll get changed.

16:08.320 --> 16:10.160
Something's wrong with his eyes.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.280
People with color blindness

16:19.360 --> 16:21.040
or slight color-blindness
are more sensitive

16:21.120 --> 16:22.920
to brightness, shapes,

16:23.000 --> 16:24.680
contours, structures, and space

16:25.200 --> 16:27.520
and have a better night vision,

16:27.600 --> 16:30.040
so they're often considered
special talents.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.400
You can use the bathroom.

16:53.880 --> 16:57.040
The red watermelon looks sweet.

17:01.240 --> 17:04.079
And the white dragon fruit is so fresh.

17:04.160 --> 17:05.200
Do you want to taste them?

17:06.720 --> 17:08.599
I don't eat fruits at this hour.
Suit yourself.

17:17.040 --> 17:21.760
Tang Qi is a tetrachromat
who's very sensitive to colors.

17:21.839 --> 17:24.079
How could he become colorblind?

17:39.560 --> 17:43.120
The red watermelon must be sweet.

17:46.760 --> 17:50.560
Is this watermelon red?

17:51.160 --> 17:54.880
Of course not. It's yellow.

17:56.080 --> 17:59.840
Well, you said
the red watermelon looked sweet,

17:59.920 --> 18:01.560
but you're eating yellow watermelon.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.880
Yes. I don't like overly sweet food,

18:05.960 --> 18:07.960
so I prefer yellow watermelon.

18:13.080 --> 18:14.800
What's going on?

18:14.880 --> 18:17.400
He can see the color
of the watermelon in my hand

18:17.480 --> 18:19.680
but not the watermelon on the plate.

18:23.600 --> 18:26.360
Does he know something's wrong
with my eyes?

18:31.160 --> 18:33.400
Can you pass me the red watermelon?

18:38.160 --> 18:40.240
You don't eat fruits at this hour, right?

18:41.120 --> 18:43.040
I want to eat it now.

18:53.520 --> 18:57.240
It seems he can see
the color of the fruits in my hand.

18:57.880 --> 19:00.760
Pick whatever you like. I'll freshen up.

19:39.240 --> 19:41.640
I'll sleep here tonight.
I'm not going back.

19:46.520 --> 19:47.360
Why?

19:50.280 --> 19:52.160
Something's wrong with his eyes.

19:52.240 --> 19:54.000
I want to confirm it.

19:54.080 --> 19:56.280
This is our first big offline event,

19:56.360 --> 19:57.400
and I'm in charge.

19:57.480 --> 19:59.080
It can't go wrong.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.680
Why are you looking at me like that?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.400
I'm looking at the painting.

21:26.000 --> 21:28.640
Didn't you say there was a mistake? Where?

21:29.160 --> 21:30.200
Here.

21:36.000 --> 21:40.120
I painted this based on the male figure
in The Knickknack Peddler.

21:40.200 --> 21:43.400
It's the male makeup of the Song dynasty,
not the Wei and Jin dynasties.

21:43.480 --> 21:45.600
WEI AND JIN, MALE MAKEUP

21:48.000 --> 21:49.400
They misplaced it.

21:50.720 --> 21:52.960
I'll contact the props team

21:53.480 --> 21:54.800
and let them correct it.

22:01.360 --> 22:03.000
Hello, Mr. Sun. I'm Gu Yu.

22:04.040 --> 22:06.000
I need to tell you something.

22:06.080 --> 22:07.000
Well…

22:09.360 --> 22:11.280
Please correct it. Thanks.

22:12.920 --> 22:13.760
Done.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.520
They'll come here to fix it.

22:17.080 --> 22:18.000
Thanks.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.600
I should thank you.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.080
You found the mistake.

22:24.240 --> 22:26.920
Why did you come here
to check the placement?

22:27.960 --> 22:30.920
Chengcheng has put
a lot of effort into this,

22:31.440 --> 22:33.320
and I couldn't sleep,

22:33.400 --> 22:34.760
so I came here

22:34.840 --> 22:37.680
to make sure that my part has no problems.

22:38.520 --> 22:40.880
Su Chengcheng is hard-working,

22:40.960 --> 22:43.080
so we let her and Wang Yi

22:43.160 --> 22:44.880
take charge of this event.

22:45.520 --> 22:47.480
What's wrong with Tang Qi's eyes?

22:50.600 --> 22:51.440
You found out?

22:54.160 --> 22:55.120
How did you know?

22:56.600 --> 22:58.800
Chengcheng found out by chance.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.960
Don't worry. We'll keep the secret.

23:05.280 --> 23:06.320
Thanks.

23:07.520 --> 23:08.880
Chengcheng is worried

23:09.400 --> 23:12.760
that his eyes
might affect tomorrow's fair.

23:14.440 --> 23:16.440
His disease is complicated.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.080
But don't worry.

23:18.160 --> 23:20.920
As long as we keep the secret,
it won't affect the event.

23:26.040 --> 23:28.560
Let's check them together.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.040
Okay.

23:43.080 --> 23:45.680
No wonder Lin said they were not busy

23:45.760 --> 23:48.320
because Mr. Tang hardly went to the lab.

23:56.400 --> 23:59.560
Mr. Zhang, you invited me to join Vandai.

23:59.640 --> 24:00.560
Is it still valid?

24:02.520 --> 24:05.400
Thank. I'll resign as soon as I can.

24:06.640 --> 24:07.960
To express my gratitude,

24:08.040 --> 24:09.960
I want to share some information with you

24:10.040 --> 24:11.880
as a gift for joining Vandai.

24:16.320 --> 24:18.880
For a better experience of our clients,

24:18.960 --> 24:21.160
we must wear ancient costumes.

24:28.280 --> 24:29.920
I can't see colors.

24:31.200 --> 24:33.640
What should I do to avoid mistakes?

25:05.960 --> 25:07.800
Why are you looking at me like this?

25:10.880 --> 25:11.800
Nothing.

25:48.240 --> 25:50.040
Bro, want some beer?

25:54.080 --> 25:56.120
Bro, want some beer?

26:16.080 --> 26:16.920
Bro,

26:17.600 --> 26:19.640
you don't look well.

26:20.480 --> 26:22.160
You can ask me anything.

26:22.760 --> 26:24.760
I'll try my best to help you.

26:27.800 --> 26:29.040
Cheers.

26:40.520 --> 26:41.600
Cheers.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.800
I must be crazy.

27:01.440 --> 27:03.320
I took your money.

27:03.400 --> 27:06.480
As the saying goes,
"You don't slack off when you're paid."

27:07.120 --> 27:09.120
Just tell me what you need.

27:17.240 --> 27:19.120
Maybe I do need to…

27:22.400 --> 27:23.600
ask you for a favor.

27:25.360 --> 27:29.080
Don't worry, girls help… girls,

27:29.160 --> 27:30.880
and boys help boys.

27:47.320 --> 27:48.720
I have this feeling

27:51.400 --> 27:52.880
that you look like someone I know.

27:55.000 --> 27:56.560
Who is it?

27:59.560 --> 28:00.520
Like…

28:14.280 --> 28:15.640
Like Fang Jin.

28:21.200 --> 28:23.640
People say a couple looks like each other.

28:24.240 --> 28:27.760
When two people are in love,
they'll act and look like each other.

28:29.160 --> 28:32.400
Remember, tell me if you need anything.

28:41.440 --> 28:43.480
I'm going to sleep. Good night.

29:02.560 --> 29:03.760
When I go back…

29:07.040 --> 29:09.920
I should definitely see a psychiatrist.

29:41.360 --> 29:42.400
Chengcheng?

29:47.120 --> 29:48.600
Sorry to wake you up.

29:52.200 --> 29:54.160
I talked with Gu Yu last night.

29:54.760 --> 29:56.880
He said Tang Qi
couldn't see colors for now.

29:56.960 --> 29:59.160
It's a mental issue,
not a physical disease.

29:59.760 --> 30:01.360
Mental issue?

30:01.440 --> 30:02.760
What mental issue?

30:02.840 --> 30:04.480
What happened to him?

30:04.560 --> 30:05.600
No idea.

30:05.680 --> 30:08.080
Gu Yu wouldn't tell me about his privacy.

30:08.600 --> 30:11.440
But I could feel
that Gu Yu was also confused.

30:12.640 --> 30:16.440
He also said he'd ask you
for a favor after the fair.

30:17.280 --> 30:21.160
Tang Qi became colorblind
after Fang Jing recovered.

30:21.920 --> 30:24.400
I thought he wanted to die.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.400
Do you think

30:27.120 --> 30:28.760
it was because of me?

30:30.120 --> 30:32.480
Tang Qi is a grown-up man.

30:32.560 --> 30:33.880
He can't be that vulnerable.

30:33.960 --> 30:37.680
Don't take the blame for everything
and push yourself too hard.

30:38.200 --> 30:40.960
His color blindness
will greatly affect the company.

30:41.040 --> 30:42.440
You must keep the secret.

30:42.520 --> 30:43.600
Got it.

30:43.680 --> 30:45.560
Gu Yu emphasized it yesterday.

30:46.680 --> 30:48.160
Go back to sleep. I'll go to work.

30:48.760 --> 30:49.960
It's so early.

30:50.040 --> 30:51.280
Have you had breakfast?

30:51.800 --> 30:54.640
There's something more important.
I'll eat later.

30:55.240 --> 30:56.080
Goodbye.

30:57.240 --> 30:58.080
Bye.

31:18.440 --> 31:20.600
TANG QI

31:28.680 --> 31:30.160
1 WHITE UNDERSHIRT

31:33.880 --> 31:34.920
2 LIGHT YELLOW MID-LAYER

31:36.440 --> 31:37.600
3 BROWN BELT

31:39.080 --> 31:40.240
2 LIGHT YELLOW MID-LAYER

31:40.320 --> 31:41.240
3 BROWN BELT

31:41.320 --> 31:42.240
4 WHITE UNDERPANTS

31:46.160 --> 31:48.080
YUE, YI, YU, JINLI, CHENGCHENG, QI

31:48.720 --> 31:51.080
To keep the secret,

31:51.600 --> 31:53.440
I can't draw attention.

31:57.520 --> 32:00.560
YUE, YI, YU, JINLI, CHENGCHENG, QI

32:25.920 --> 32:27.320
3 RED OUTWEAR, 1 WHITE UNDERSHIRT

32:27.400 --> 32:30.040
2 ROYAL BLUE COAT, 1 WHITE UNDERSHIRT

32:33.760 --> 32:34.760
This is yours.

32:35.360 --> 32:36.440
- Here.
- Thanks.

32:36.520 --> 32:37.440
You're welcome.

32:41.000 --> 32:41.920
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

32:42.000 --> 32:44.200
Lin's clothes… Right here.

32:44.280 --> 32:45.640
Here you are.

32:47.920 --> 32:50.400
Su Chengcheng, you're so thoughtful.

32:50.480 --> 32:51.760
You even labeled the dressing order.

32:51.840 --> 32:53.920
I couldn't figure out how to wear them.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.040
Don't be so polite.

32:55.120 --> 32:56.960
WHITE UNDERSHIRT, ROYAL BLUE COAT

33:00.760 --> 33:03.160
- Here, this is yours.
- Thanks.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.840
WHITE UNDERSHIRT, WHITE UNDERPANTS

33:10.920 --> 33:12.600
It must've taken a lot of time
to make these labels.

33:14.040 --> 33:15.320
It's okay.

33:15.400 --> 33:18.880
Mr. Gu emphasized
that this is our first big offline event,

33:18.960 --> 33:20.360
and it can't go wrong.

33:22.280 --> 33:25.120
- Okay, thanks.
- That's my duty.

33:33.600 --> 33:37.720
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION
SPRING MAKEUP FAIR

33:46.160 --> 33:47.960
These paintings look so good.

33:50.040 --> 33:51.000
Indeed.

33:54.240 --> 33:56.440
They look great like this.

34:05.800 --> 34:07.600
- What do you think?
- Not bad.

34:07.680 --> 34:08.719
TBC, LIPSTICK & ROUGE

34:08.800 --> 34:10.040
Look at this one.

34:10.760 --> 34:12.239
Dad, see?

34:12.320 --> 34:13.480
Emperors in the Tang dynasty

34:13.560 --> 34:15.960
would bestow rouge and facial cream
to the officials

34:16.040 --> 34:17.679
for skin care.

34:17.760 --> 34:20.440
They believed men should also
take care of their skin.

34:20.520 --> 34:23.679
This event has exceeded our expectations.

34:25.719 --> 34:27.400
Su Chengcheng is capable.

34:29.560 --> 34:31.520
Shouldn't you praise Gu Yu too?

34:39.960 --> 34:42.440
Isn't that the new
marketing director of Vandai?

34:42.520 --> 34:43.880
Why is he here?

34:52.000 --> 34:53.080
- Mr. Zhou.
- Hello.

34:53.600 --> 34:56.199
I heard you planned
a traditional makeup fair,

34:56.719 --> 34:59.040
so we came here to learn.

34:59.120 --> 35:00.000
I'm flattered.

35:00.080 --> 35:02.440
We have a lot to learn from you.

35:04.680 --> 35:07.680
Hello. I'm Tan Yu
from the R&D Department of Vandai.

35:08.640 --> 35:09.640
Hello.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.880
Dr. Tang, I've heard a lot about you.

35:11.960 --> 35:14.520
I know you're famous
for the mastery of colors.

35:15.560 --> 35:19.480
I wonder if you could please
make a lipstick for us

35:19.560 --> 35:21.160
so that I can learn something.

35:21.240 --> 35:22.080
No!

35:24.680 --> 35:25.520
Well,

35:26.160 --> 35:27.800
Tang has no time.

35:31.040 --> 35:33.480
We can wait until Dr. Tang is available.

35:33.560 --> 35:35.600
Yes, we have time.

35:36.120 --> 35:40.080
We can wait as long
as it takes to see the results.

35:42.840 --> 35:44.200
Well, he…

35:45.960 --> 35:48.320
Making lipstick only needs a few colors.

35:48.840 --> 35:51.920
Why don't we go to the product trial spot?

35:52.000 --> 35:57.080
I'll show you the color matching
of makeup and clothes.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.600
Thank you, Dr. Tang.

36:07.720 --> 36:09.320
We'll wait for you over there.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.360
Okay.

36:15.480 --> 36:17.920
It seems Mr. Zhang is up to no good.

36:20.040 --> 36:21.720
Did he get some information?

36:23.560 --> 36:25.640
You should find a way to reject him.

36:26.600 --> 36:27.920
They want to test us.

36:28.560 --> 36:30.360
Avoidance will only make them
more suspicious.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.440
You have a point.

36:32.520 --> 36:33.640
So, what should we do?

36:45.840 --> 36:48.400
TANG QI

36:51.320 --> 36:53.200
Come on. Slightly bend the sword.

36:53.280 --> 36:54.320
Look up and use strength.

36:54.400 --> 36:55.800
Yes, keep your shoulders straight.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.560
- Okay, I'll try it again.
- Okay.

37:05.640 --> 37:07.120
Hello. What's wrong?

37:08.480 --> 37:10.480
I met Mr. Zhang before.

37:10.560 --> 37:12.320
He likes playing dirty.

37:12.400 --> 37:13.720
You're doing the right thing.

37:17.360 --> 37:20.360
There's something
I wanted to tell you after the fair.

37:21.800 --> 37:24.000
Su Chengcheng knows about your eyes.

37:25.240 --> 37:27.880
Okay. I'll find Su Chengcheng.

37:30.120 --> 37:31.400
Excuse me.

37:31.480 --> 37:33.400
Where's Su Chengcheng?
